<title>USA: TABLE-Keystone Heritage Q2 shr $0.78.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Keystone Heritage Q2 shr $0.78.</headline>
<dateline>LEBANON, Pa. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>KEYSTONE HERITAGE GROUP INC</p>
<p>		 (Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p> Period ended		Quarter-to-date	   Year-to-date</p>
<p> June 30		   1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
